4: $1 \times (10+1) = 11$
Max = 12. Output 12.

$k=2$:
1: $3 \times (3+2) = 15$
2: $5 \times (1+2) = 15$
3: $2 \times (4+2) = 12$
4: $1 \times (10+2) = 12$
Max = 15. Output 15.

$k=3$:
